    <h2>1. Independent Website — No Affiliation with Dairy Queen</h2>
    <p>thequeendairymenu.us (The Dairy Queen Menu) is an <strong>independent, privately operated reference website</strong>. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or in any way officially connected to Dairy Queen®, International Dairy Queen, Inc., Berkshire Hathaway (the parent company of International Dairy Queen), or any Dairy Queen franchise operators.</p>
    <p>"Dairy Queen," "DQ," "Blizzard," "Stackburger," "Grill &amp; Chill," "DQ Treat," and all related product names and logos are registered trademarks of International Dairy Queen, Inc. These marks are used on this website solely for nominative reference purposes — to identify and describe the menu items being discussed — and do not imply any affiliation, sponsorship, or endorsement by the trademark owner.</p>

    <h2>2. Prices Are Estimates — Not Guaranteed</h2>
    <p>All menu prices listed on this website are <strong>national average estimates based on publicly available information compiled in 2025–2026</strong>. Dairy Queen is a franchise system — individual franchise locations set their own prices, which may differ significantly from the national averages we list. Prices also vary by:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Geographic region (prices in major metropolitan areas are typically higher than in rural areas)</li>
      <li>State and local taxes</li>
      <li>Individual franchise operator pricing decisions</li>
      <li>Time — prices change due to inflation and supply costs</li>
      <li>Order method — mobile app, drive-through, dine-in, and delivery prices may differ</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Always verify current prices directly with your local Dairy Queen location before visiting.</strong> We accept no responsibility for any discrepancies between prices listed on this Website and actual prices charged at any Dairy Queen location.</p>

    <h2>3. Menu Items and Availability</h2>
    <p>The Dairy Queen menu varies significantly by location. Not all items listed on this Website are available at all Dairy Queen locations. Key variations include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>DQ Grill &amp; Chill vs. DQ Treat locations</strong> — Grill &amp; Chill locations serve the full food and treats menu. DQ Treat locations serve only frozen treats (Blizzards, cones, sundaes, cakes). Many items on this site are only available at Grill &amp; Chill locations.</li>
      <li><strong>Breakfast availability</strong> — DQ breakfast is only served at select locations, primarily in the U.S. South and Midwest.</li>
      <li><strong>Seasonal items</strong> — Seasonal Blizzard flavors and limited-time items are available for limited periods and not at all locations.</li>
      <li><strong>Regional variations</strong> — Some menu items are only available in certain regions.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Use the official Dairy Queen website or DQ app to find your nearest location and confirm current menu availability before visiting.</p>

    <h2>4. Calorie and Nutritional Information</h2>
    <p>Calorie counts and nutritional information on this website are sourced from publicly available DQ nutritional guides and are provided as general reference only. Actual nutritional values may vary due to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Regional ingredient sourcing differences</li>
      <li>Preparation variation by location</li>
      <li>Customization and add-ons</li>
      <li>Updates to recipes and formulations by Dairy Queen</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This information is not intended as medical or dietary advice. Consult a qualified healthcare professional or registered dietitian for personalized nutritional guidance. For the most accurate and up-to-date nutritional information, consult the official Dairy Queen nutritional guide available at dairyqueen.com.</p>

    <h2>5. Allergen Information</h2>
    <p>We provide general allergen information on some pages for informational reference only. DQ kitchens handle multiple allergens and cross-contamination is possible. <strong>If you have a food allergy or dietary restriction, do not rely on this website for allergen information.</strong> Contact your specific Dairy Queen location directly and consult the official DQ allergen guide before ordering.</p>

    <h2>6. Images, Media, and Trademarks</h2>
    <p>Product names, logos, and brand features referenced on this website — including “Dairy Queen,” “DQ,” “Blizzard,” and related marks — are the trademarks of International Dairy Queen, Inc. They appear here only for <strong>nominative reference</strong>: to identify and describe the menu items discussed. Their use does not imply affiliation, sponsorship, or endorsement.</p>
    <p>Food and product images are provided for identification and illustration of the menu items being described, on an informational reference basis. We claim no ownership of any Dairy Queen trademark or brand imagery. <strong>If you are the rights holder of any image or mark used on this site and believe it has been used improperly, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a> and we will promptly review and remove or replace the material.</strong> We respond to valid takedown requests in good faith and without delay.</p>

    <h2>7. Advertising Disclosure</h2>
    <p>This website participates in the Google AdSense advertising program. Advertisements are displayed on various pages throughout this website. <strong>Advertisements are clearly displayed as advertising content.</strong> We do not editorially endorse any product or service advertised on this site. The presence of an advertisement on any page of this Website does not indicate an endorsement or recommendation by The Dairy Queen Menu.</p>
    <p>We may also include affiliate links in some content. If and when affiliate links are present, they will be disclosed in accordance with FTC guidelines. We only include links to products and services we believe are relevant and useful.</p>

    <h2>8. No Professional Advice</h2>
    <p>The content on this Website is for general informational and reference purposes only. Nothing on this Website constitutes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Medical, dietary, or nutritional advice</li>
      <li>Legal or regulatory advice</li>
      <li>Financial advice</li>
      <li>Official Dairy Queen communication or policy</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For official information about Dairy Queen products, nutrition, allergens, franchise opportunities, or corporate matters, contact Dairy Queen directly at <a href="https://www.dairyqueen.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dairyqueen.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>9. Accuracy and Updates</h2>
    <p>We make reasonable efforts to keep information on this Website current and accurate. However, the DQ menu changes regularly — new items are added, items are discontinued, prices are updated, and seasonal items rotate. We cannot guarantee that all information is current at any given time.</p>
    <p>If you notice inaccurate information on this Website, please use our <a href="/contact">contact form</a> to report it. We will review and update the information promptly.</p>

    <h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
